/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Regardless of how reliable a pattern might be, it makes absolutely no sense to trade it outside of the general context of the market buyers. This is one of the many mistakes beginners make when using day trading patterns. They take every pattern hook, line, and sinker without trying to see the full market picture on bigger timeframes.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
